    </figure>
<h2 id="overview" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#overview" class="header-mark"></a>Overview</h2><p>I started working as a team lead and realized that there were so many things going on that I had to keep track of. Being the goldfish, I couldn&rsquo;t remember alot of things&hellip; One particular thing that was important for me as the team lead was the status of my team members.</p>]]></description>
